		<footer class="analytics-footer card-base" data-analytics-footer>
			<div>
				<span class="analytics-footer__eyebrow">A SMALL PUBLIC RECORD</span>
				<strong>谢谢你来过，也谢谢你愿意留下几秒钟。</strong>
			</div>
